{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/coordinate-geometry/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/coordinate-geometry.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Geometry - Coordinate Geometry","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"accent-gradient text-white sticky top-0 z-40\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/\" class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-2 bg-white/20 rounded-lg\"><span class=\"mi -vector-square\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span></div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Coordinate Geometry</div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs opacity-90\">Distance, midpoint, slope and line equations</div>\n        </div>\n      </a>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <div class=\"text-sm opacity-90\">Progress: <span id=\"progress\">0%</span></div>\n        <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/\" class=\"text-white/90 hover:text-white text-sm\">Back to Math</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8\">\n    <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n      <aside class=\"lg:col-span-1\">\n        <div class=\"bg-white p-5 rounded-xl card-glow sticky top-24\">\n          <h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-3\">Contents</h3>\n          <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\">\n            <li><a href=\"#distance\" class=\"hover:text-sky-700 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">1</span>Distance</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#midpoint\" class=\"hover:text-sky-700 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">2</span>Midpoint</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#slope\" class=\"hover:text-sky-700 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">3</span>Slope &amp; Line</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#practice\" class=\"hover:text-sky-700 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"step-badge\">4</span>Practice</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n\n      <section class=\"lg:col-span-3 space-y-6\">\n        <article id=\"distance\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-sky-700 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -ruler\" data-mi=\"straighten\">straighten</span></div>\n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-2\">Distance formula</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Distance between (x1,y1) and (x2,y2): <code class=\"font-mono\">√[(x2-x1)² + (y2-y1)²]</code>.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"midpoint\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-sky-700 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -crosshairs\" data-mi=\"gps_fixed\">gps_fixed</span></div>\n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Midpoint</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Midpoint: <code class=\"font-mono\">((x1+x2)/2, (y1+y2)/2)</code>.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"slope\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-sky-700 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -slash\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span></div>\n            <div>\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Slope &amp; Equation of a line</h2>\n              <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Slope (m) = (y2 - y1) / (x2 - x1). Line equation: y = mx + c (slope-intercept) or point-slope form.</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <article id=\"practice\" class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl card-glow\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"text-3xl text-sky-700 mt-1\"><span class=\"mi -pencil-alt\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span></div>\n            <div class=\"w-full\">\n              <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Practice Problems</h2>\n              <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">1) Distance between (1,2) and (4,6)</div>\n                  <input id=\"p1\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 5\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-sky-700 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb1\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-4 border rounded-md bg-gray-50\">\n                  <div class=\"font-semibold\">2) Slope of line through (0,0) &amp; (3,3)</div>\n                  <input id=\"p2\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1\">\n                  <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"c2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-sky-700 text-white rounded text-sm\">Check</button><button id=\"h2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs bg-white border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n                  <div id=\"fb2\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm\"></div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <button id=\"quizBtn\" class=\"fixed bottom-8 right-8 z-50 bg-sky-700 text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-sky-800 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"mi -bolt\" data-mi=\"bolt\">bolt</span> Quiz</button>\n\n  <div id=\"quizModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-50 flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl shadow-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 relative\">\n      <button id=\"closeQuiz\" class=\"absolute top-3 right-4 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 text-2xl\">×</button>\n      <div id=\"quizContent\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 text-sm text-gray-500\">Coordinate Geometry — interactive lesson</footer>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-sky-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":["@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0 } to { opacity: 1 } }\n    .card-glow { box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(99,102,241,0.06); animation: fadeIn 0.45s ease; }\n    .accent-gradient { background: linear-gradient(90deg,#06b6d4,#14b8a6); }\n    .step-badge { background: rgba(6,182,212,0.08); color:#064e3b; padding:.25rem .5rem; border-radius:.5rem; font-weight:600; display:inline-block; width:24px; height:24px; text-align:center; font-size:.75rem }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":["#distance","#midpoint","#slope","#practice"]}